00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,620
Every year, India produces about
1.1 crore graduates.

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,600
Only about half are judged
ready for a job.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:13,260
Only 1 in 10 Indians speak English. Yet
engineering is taught in English.

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:18,420
Qubirex teaches in Telugu, Hindi, or the
mix students actually speak.

5
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,069
Professor Qubirex explains every line,

6
00:00:22,119 --> 00:00:26,720
and every skill students prove goes on a
signed Capability Passport.

7
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,990
IT fresher hiring has fallen
80% in three years.

8
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:35,940
As Jensen Huang said: you're not going
to lose your job to an AI,

9
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:39,360
but you're going to lose your job
to someone who uses AI.

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:44,160
AI is the recipe. You still cook.
Why shouldn't that be you?

11
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:50,540
Qubirex. Your language. Your
skills. Your future.
